{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "pos-completo-v2",
    "name": "POS System — Colección Completa",
    "description": "# POS System — Todos los Endpoints\n\nCubre el flujo completo de prueba: desde el registro hasta la facturación electrónica, incluyendo el flujo del Super Admin para habilitar un local.\n\n**Flujo recomendado:**\n1. Super Admin: crear local y cargar credenciales de Factus\n2. Admin: registrar catálogo, clientes, proveedores y stock\n3. Admin: configurar rango de numeración\n4. Admin: registrar ventas con factura electrónica\n\n**Credenciales por defecto:** `admin` / `Password123`\n\nTodos los tokens y IDs se propagan automáticamente entre peticiones.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{bearer_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "bearer_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "superadmin_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "store_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "category_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "subcategory_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "product_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customer_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "supplier_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "range_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "sale_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "purchase_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01. 🔐 Autenticación",
      "description": "Login del Super Admin y del Administrador de local. El Super Admin activa la facturación; el Admin gestiona el día a día.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Super Admin (captura superadmin_token)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "var d = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('superadmin_token', d.token || d.accessToken || '');",
            "console.log('✅ Super Admin logueado');"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"superadmin\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Administrador (captura bearer_token)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "var d = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('bearer_token', d.token || d.accessToken || '');",
            "if (d.storeId) pm.collectionVariables.set('store_id', String(d.storeId));",
            "console.log('✅ Admin logueado. Store ID:', d.storeId);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar nuevo Administrador (opcional)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"201 o 400 si ya existe\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([201,400]));",
            "console.log('ℹ️ Si es 400, el usuario ya existe — usa Login directamente.');"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"nuevo_admin\",\n  \"email\": \"nuevo@tienda.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Password123\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Juan\",\n  \"lastName\": \"García\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Token",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
            "  var d = pm.response.json();",
            "  pm.collectionVariables.set('bearer_token', d.accessToken || d.token || '');",
            "  console.log('✅ Token renovado.');",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","auth","refresh"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02. 🏪 Local Comercial (Admin)",
      "description": "El Administrador registra y consulta su local. Sin local, no puede operar.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar Mi Local",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"201 o 400\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200,201,400,409]));",
            "var d = pm.response.json();",
            "if (d && d.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('store_id', String(d.id)); console.log('✅ Local creado ID:', d.id); }"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Tienda Demo\",\n  \"address\": \"Calle 123 # 45-67, Bogotá\",\n  \"phone\": \"+57 310 123 4567\",\n  \"taxId\": \"900123456-7\",\n  \"email\": \"contacto@tiendademo.com\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stores", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","stores"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar Mi Local",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "var d = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('store_id', String(d.id));",
            "console.log('📍 Local:', d.name, '| ID:', d.id);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stores/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","stores","me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar Mi Local",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Tienda Demo Actualizada\",\n  \"address\": \"Av. Principal # 10-20\",\n  \"phone\": \"+57 310 999 8888\",\n  \"email\": \"nuevo@tiendademo.com\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stores/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","stores","me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Subir Documento del Local (RUT, etc.)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": "/ruta/a/rut.pdf", "description": "Selecciona el archivo" },
                { "key": "documentType", "value": "RUT", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stores/me/documents", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","stores","me","documents"] },
            "description": "Sube un documento del local (RUT, cámara de comercio, etc.) en multipart/form-data."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03. ⚙️ Configuración del Negocio",
      "description": "Ajustes generales del local: nombre, NIT, dirección, logo.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consultar Configuración",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/settings", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","settings"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar Configuración",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"businessName\": \"Tienda Demo SAS\",\n  \"address\": \"Calle 123 # 45-67, Bogotá\",\n  \"phone\": \"+57 1 234 5678\",\n  \"taxId\": \"900123456-1\",\n  \"email\": \"info@tiendademo.com\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/settings", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","settings"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04. 📦 Catálogo — Categorías y Productos",
      "description": "Gestión del catálogo de productos.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar Categorías (globales, SUPER_ADMIN las crea)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "var cats = pm.response.json();",
            "if (Array.isArray(cats) && cats.length > 0) {",
            "  pm.collectionVariables.set('category_id', String(cats[0].id));",
            "  console.log('📂 Categorías disponibles:', cats.map(c => c.id + ':' + c.name).join(', '));",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","categories"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Subcategorías del Local",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"200 OK\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
            "var subs = pm.response.json();",
            "if (Array.isArray(subs) && subs.length > 0) pm.collectionVariables.set('subcategory_id', String(subs[0].id));"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subcategories", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","subcategories"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear Subcategoría del Local",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"201 Created\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "var d = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('subcategory_id', String(d.id));",
            "console.log('✅ Subcategoría creada ID:', d.id);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Lácteos\",\n  \"categoryId\": {{category_id}}\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subcategories", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","subcategories"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Productos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=0&size=20", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","products"], "query": [{"key":"page","value":"0"},{"key":"size","value":"20"}] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear Producto",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"201 Created\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "var d = pm.response.json();",
            "pm.collectionVariables.set('product_id', String(d.id));",
            "console.log('✅ Producto creado ID:', d.id, '|', d.name);"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"internalCode\": \"PROD-001\",\n  \"barcode\": \"7702011477014\",\n  \"name\": \"Arroz Diana 500g\",\n  \"categoryId\": {{category_id}},\n  \"purchasePrice\": 2500.00,\n  \"salePrice\": 3200.00,\n  \"minStock\": 20,\n  \"description\": \"Arroz blanco de primera calidad\",\n  \"taxRate\": 0.00,\n  \"unspscCode\": \"50202301\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","products"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar Producto por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{product_id}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","products","{{product_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar Producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Arroz Diana 500g Premium\",\n  \"purchasePrice\": 2800.00,\n  \"salePrice\": 3500.00,\n  \"minStock\": 25,\n  \"taxRate\": 0.00\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{product_id}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","products","{{product_id}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Activar / Desactivar Producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{ \"active\": false }" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{product_id}}/status", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","products","{{product_id}}","status"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05. 📥 Inventario",
      "description": "Movimientos de stock: entradas, salidas y ajustes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar Entrada de Stock",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "pm.test(\"201 Created\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
            "console.log('✅ Movimiento registrado. Stock actualizado.');"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": {{product_id}},\n  \"movementType\": \"ENTRY\",\n  \"quantity\": 100,\n  \"reason\": \"Recepción inicial de mercancía\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/movements", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","inventory","movements"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar Ajuste de Inventario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"productId\": {{product_id}},\n  \"movementType\": \"ADJUSTMENT\",\n  \"quantity\": -5,\n  \"reason\": \"Merma por deterioro\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/movements", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","inventory","movements"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar Movimientos de Inventario",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/movements?productId={{product_id}}&page=0&size=20", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api","v1","inventory","movements"], "query": [{"key":"productId","value":"{{product_id}}"},{"key":"page","value":"0"},{"key":"size","value":"20"}] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06. 👥 Clientes",
      "description": "Gestión de clientes compradores.",
      "item": [
